Subject: [PATCH 09/14] Web Extensions: test
 webNavigation.onCreatedNavigationTarget (Sunset W4)

WKWebExtensionAPIWebNavigationTests.createdNavigationTargetEvent: a page opens a window; the event comes with the opener
tab, the main frame (0) and a new tab. The test harness's tabs now answer createWebView by opening a tab in their window
(as a browser does), its web view made from WebKit's configuration; without the previous patch the listener cannot be
added (onCreatedNavigationTarget undefined).

